seg-1dd1beb01075 = MODELLED: a geometric and link-budget sweep. The booklet pattern is a constant-power main lobe, the parametric pattern a representative stand-in, and the limb-ray medium a simple stated model; nothing here is a measurement of a signal in space. The availability and outage figures follow the method of the ICG Space Service Volume booklet (UN ST/SPACE/75) and are checked against its tables in xval/gnss-ssv/. (result <c1/>)

